> Refer to the [Importing Billing and Payment data](https://developer.imis.com/v20.3.200/docs/importing-billing-and-payment-data) tutorial for a guide to importing billing data with the DuesImportPackage service. 


With the DuesImportPackage service, you can perform the following operations on the execute endpoint:

- DuesImportPackageGetPackageResultsRequest

- DuesImportPackageGetPackageStatusRequest

- DuesImportPackagePostRequest

- ImportPackage

- GetPackageStatus

- GetPackageResults


## DuesImportPackageGetPackageResultsRequest

###### BODY PARAMS:

``` json
{
  "$type": "Asi.Soa.Commerce.DataContracts.DuesImportPackageGetPackageResultsRequest, Asi.Contracts",
  "EntityTypeName": "DuesImportPackage",
  "OperationName": "GetPackageResults",
  "DuesImportPackageId": 8635,
  "RequestCulture": "string value"
}

 ```

## DuesImportPackageGetPackageStatusRequest

###### BODY PARAMS:

``` json
{
  "$type": "Asi.Soa.Commerce.DataContracts.DuesImportPackageGetPackageStatusRequest, Asi.Contracts",
  "EntityTypeName": "DuesImportPackage",
  "OperationName": "GetPackageStatus",
  "DuesImportPackageId": 8635,
  "RequestCulture": "string value"
}

 ```

## DuesImportPackagePostRequest

###### BODY PARAMS:

``` json
{
  "$type": "Asi.Soa.Commerce.DataContracts.DuesImportPackagePostRequest, Asi.Contracts",
  "EntityTypeName": "DuesImportPackage",
  "OperationName": "ImportPackage",
  "DuesImportPackage": {
    "$type": "Asi.Soa.Commerce.DataContracts.DuesImportPackageData, Asi.Contracts"
  },
  "RequestCulture": "string value"
}

 ```

## ImportPackage

###### BODY PARAMS:

``` json
{
  "$type": "Asi.Soa.Core.DataContracts.GenericExecuteRequest, Asi.Contracts",
  "OperationName": "ImportPackage",
