item.description:
With the RateCardDetail service, you can perform the following operations on the execute endpoint:

- GetRateCardsCostPerWord

- CreateRateCardDetailsMatrix


## GetRateCardsCostPerWord

###### BODY PARAMS:

``` json
{
  "$type": "Asi.Soa.Core.DataContracts.GenericExecuteRequest, Asi.Contracts",
  "OperationName": "GetRateCardsCostPerWord",
  "EntityTypeName": "RateCardDetail",
  "Parameters": {
    "$type": "System.Collections.ObjectModel.Collection`1[[System.Object, mscorlib]], mscorlib",
    "$values": [
      {
        "$type": "System.Int32",
        "$value": "rateCardId Value"
      },
      {
        "$type": "System.Int32",
        "$value": "mediaColorId Value"
      }
    ]
  },
  "ParameterTypeName": {
    "$type": "System.Collections.ObjectModel.Collection`1[[System.String, mscorlib]], mscorlib",
    "$values": [
      "System.Int32",
      "System.Int32"
    ]
  },
  "UseJson": false
}

 ```

## CreateRateCardDetailsMatrix

###### BODY PARAMS:

``` json
{
  "$type": "Asi.Soa.Core.DataContracts.GenericExecuteRequest, Asi.Contracts",
  "OperationName": "CreateRateCardDetailsMatrix",
  "EntityTypeName": "RateCardDetail",
  "Parameters": {
    "$type": "System.Collections.ObjectModel.Collection`1[[System.Object, mscorlib]], mscorlib",
    "$values": [
      {
        "$type": "System.Int32",
        "$value": "rateCardId Value"
      },
      {
        "$type": "System.Int32",
        "$value": "mediaColorId Value"
      },
      {
        "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable`1[[Asi.Soa.Media.DataContracts.RateCardDetailData, Asi.Contracts]]",
        "$value": "contracts Value"
      }
    ]
  },
  "ParameterTypeName": {
    "$type": "System.Collections.ObjectModel.Collection`1[[System.String, mscorlib]], mscorlib",
    "$values": [
      "System.Int32",
      "System.Int32",
      "System.Collections.Generic.IEnumerable`1[[Asi.Soa.Media.DataContracts.RateCardDetailData, Asi.Contracts]]"
    ]
  },
  "UseJson": false
}

 ```

